  <diagram id="FHoOcYePMkjLbZUYT7qY" name="Centralize Recording Feature (A.I.)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1420" dy="822" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="Za0F_fskA7HowWR0pylS-1" value="&lt;b id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-4557fd73-7fff-b7a6-90b3-11d02b06ff66&quot; style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;For a dedicated &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Search &amp;amp; Playback Solution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; that ingests recording files and metadata from external recording systems (such as Avaya, Genesys, Cisco, 3CX, or custom recorders), your system functions as a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Centralized Recording Vault &amp;amp; Search Portal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;To deliver a high-performing product, your features can be divided into &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Standard Features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; (core requirements) and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Advanced Features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; (key differentiators).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;1. Core Standard Features (Baseline Requirements)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;These features represent the minimum capabilities required for a production-ready search and playback system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;A. Ingestion &amp;amp; Data Pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Batch &amp;amp; Real-Time Ingestion Engine:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Automated watchers (S3/Blob polling, SFTP, local directory monitoring, or Webhooks/REST APIs) to pick up new media files and metadata (JSON/XML/CSV) as calls end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Metadata Normalization &amp;amp; Mapping:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Mapping disparate metadata schemas from different recorders into a unified database format (e.g., mapping ani / dnis / caller_id to standard fields).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Storage &amp;amp; Index Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Storing raw media files efficiently (or linking to external storage) and indexing CTI metadata for fast querying.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Ingestion Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ) &amp;amp; Reconciliation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Handling missing files, corrupt audio, or delayed metadata with automated retry mechanisms and error alerts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;B. Multi-Criteria Search Portal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Telephony &amp;amp; CTI Filtering:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Search by Agent ID, Extension, Queue/Skill, Direction (Inbound/Outbound/Internal), Duration, Date/Time range, and Call Identifiers (Call UUID, Session ID).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Tag &amp;amp; Metadata Filtering:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Search by injected tags (e.g., #billing, #escalated), disposition codes, or attached CRM IDs (Customer ID, Ticket Number).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Saveable Search Presets:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Allow supervisors to save frequently used filter sets (e.g., &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&quot;My Team&#39;s Calls &amp;gt; 10 Mins from Yesterday&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;C. Web-Based Media Player Workspace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Multi-Track Audio Waveform:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Visual audio player rendering separate channels (Agent vs. Customer) to quickly spot cross-talk or long pauses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre; margin-left: -6.48pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3799999713897704;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Timeline CTI Event Markers:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Visual markers on the player track indicating key events like &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Hold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Resume&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline